-- Fact 5 past a guard (`backend.md` §9, *slice 4*, amended 2026-10-02),
-- printing the same in both builds: in the platform module, a root past a
-- guard that refuses `null` and reads one of its properties, whose holder's
-- fallback goes; and one past a guard that refuses only `undefined`, which
-- is `null` and takes the fallback.
import Guards
import Node


main : Node.Program
main = Node.printLines (Guards.demo ())
